WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:05.367
Lily Zusk looked at the crowd. "Who wants to teleport next?"

2
00:00:05.368 --> 00:00:07.742
Several people raised their hands.

3
00:00:07.743 --> 00:00:09.676
Roxy leaned toward Terrell.

4
00:00:09.677 --> 00:00:14.545
"I'll be right back," she whispered. "Lily is stealing things."

5
00:00:14.546 --> 00:00:17.938
"Really?" Terrell whispered. "How?"

6
00:00:17.939 --> 00:00:20.539
"I'm not sure," Roxy said.

7
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:24.235
"She must be teleporting valuable things to a different place.

8
00:00:24.236 --> 00:00:26.343
Rocket Girl will handle it."

9
00:00:26.344 --> 00:00:32.008
Terrell smiled. "Good luck!"

10
00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:37.167
Roxy ducked behind a sign. Then she jumped back out.

11
00:00:37.168 --> 00:00:41.656
"Hey, look!" a kid shouted. "It's Rocket Girl!"

12
00:00:41.657 --> 00:00:46.349
Roxy stomped toward Lily Zusk. "You're under arrest!"

13
00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.830
She expected Lily Zusk to get angry.

14
00:00:48.831 --> 00:00:51.262
But instead the woman smiled.

15
00:00:51.263 --> 00:00:56.487
"Rocket Girl!" Lily said. "I'm so happy to see you!"

16
00:00:56.488 --> 00:00:58.261
Roxy scratched her head.

17
00:00:58.262 --> 00:01:02.316
"Why are you happy to see me? I'm going to arrest you."

18
00:01:02.316 --> 00:01:07.924
Lily laughed. "Oh, you won't arrest me.

19
00:01:07.925 --> 00:01:14.037
You might try, of course. But you'll find out that's impossible."

20
00:01:14.038 --> 00:01:16.976
Lily pressed some buttons on the side of one booth.

21
00:01:16.977 --> 00:01:19.882
"Do you know why that's impossible?"

22
00:01:19.883 --> 00:01:22.797
Roxy frowned. "Why?"

23
00:01:22.798 --> 00:01:26.256
"Because you'll never catch me!"

24
00:01:26.257 --> 00:01:29.927
Lily ran into the booth and disappeared.

25
00:01:29.928 --> 00:01:35.455
Zoom! Roxy flew into the booth too. Light flashed.

26
00:01:35.456 --> 00:01:38.425
Suddenly she was standing in the middle of a street.

27
00:01:38.426 --> 00:01:42.049
Beep, beep! A car was speeding toward her.

28
00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:45.048
"Yikes!" Roxy jumped out of the way. Honk!

29
00:01:45.049 --> 00:01:48.924
Honk! A huge truck drove fast. Roxy

30
00:01:48.925 --> 00:01:53.184
jumped again. She landed on a crowded sidewalk. "Hey!"

31
00:01:53.185 --> 00:01:56.188
an old woman said. "You

32
00:01:56.189 --> 00:02:02.357
almost knocked me over! Oh, it's you, Rocket Girl!" "Sorry!"

33
00:02:02.358 --> 00:02:06.320
Roxy moved out of the way and looked around. "I

34
00:02:06.321 --> 00:02:09.899
teleported to downtown Metro City," she thought. "But

35
00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:13.872
where did Lily go?" ***

36
00:02:13.873 --> 00:02:16.008
Two men stood in a laboratory.

37
00:02:16.009 --> 00:02:18.880
A big sphere sat in the center of the room.

38
00:02:18.881 --> 00:02:21.748
Lots of wires connected the sphere to a computer.

39
00:02:21.749 --> 00:02:23.762
There were also two booths.

40
00:02:23.763 --> 00:02:28.148
Light flashed in one booth. Lily Zusk stepped out of it.

41
00:02:28.149 --> 00:02:31.822
"Hey, boss!" one man said. "How did it go?"

42
00:02:31.823 --> 00:02:35.051
"Did your plan work?" the other man asked.

43
00:02:35.052 --> 00:02:37.742
"It sure did!" Lily said.

44
00:02:37.743 --> 00:02:43.270
"Rocket Girl was at the technology hub building. And she fell for my trick!

45
00:02:43.271 --> 00:02:48.946
She saw me steal things—just like I hoped she would. And now . . ."

46
00:02:48.947 --> 00:02:53.798
Lily stepped in front of the big sphere. "She's somewhere else!"

47
00:02:53.799 --> 00:03:01.723
The men laughed. Lily sat down at the computer.

48
00:03:01.724 --> 00:03:05.230
"What do we do now, boss?" one of the men asked.

49
00:03:05.231 --> 00:03:07.193
Lily looked over her shoulder.

50
00:03:07.194 --> 00:03:09.047
"Gather the entire crew.

51
00:03:09.048 --> 00:03:14.938
I want you all to rob every bank in the city!"

